menu "Lume local web server (r71)"
    config LUME_WEB_PORT
        int "Local web server default listen port"
        default 8080
        range 1024 65535
        help
            Default TCP port for the JS-defined LAN web server. The server is
            OFF by default and only binds while the WiFi station has an IPv4
            address and an app explicitly called lume.net.web.start({token}).
            The app may override the port in start() (1024-65535). Independent
            of the WiFi OTA port (CONFIG_LUME_OTA_PORT, 8765).
endmenu
